@startuml
title Tutor learning workflow v1
|AI Tutor|
start
:Load current checkpoint and evidence;
if (Prerequisites and authored content available?) then (yes)
repeat
:Teach one model;
|Student|
:Predict and explain;
|AI Tutor|
:Give guided task, usually 1-2 commands;
|Student|
:Run and submit real output;
|Evaluator|
:Verify scope of output;
repeat while (Need bounded remediation and student agrees?) is (yes) not (no)
if (Guided evidence sufficient?) then (yes)
|AI Tutor|
:Assign independent variant without solution;
|Student|
:Work independently;
|Evaluator|
:Verify submitted artifact and reasoning;
if (Required evidence sufficient?) then (yes)
|Evidence Store|
:Apply authorized proposal, validate, commit;
:Schedule review;
else (no)
|AI Tutor|
:Record gap, offer targeted remediation or pause;
endif
else (no)
|AI Tutor|
:Explain gap; offer remediation or pause;
endif
else (no)
:Stop and report blocked prerequisite;
endif
|Student|
if (Pause requested?) then (yes)
|Evidence Store|
:Save resume_state and verified checkpoint;
|AI Tutor|
:Resume later from saved state, retain valid evidence;
endif
stop
@enduml
